nt","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"And we always have the opportunity to sell at good prices and get price realization for the great new equipment and fairly used kind of assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q4-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ann Fandozzi","x":"As a result of the COVID-19 pandemic, we instructed employees at many of our offices across the globe, including our corporate headquarters, to work from home on a temporary basis, and we implemented Companywide travel restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q1-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q2","e":"rba","d":"2020-08-07","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"But we didn't have anyone in the theater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q2","e":"rba","d":"2020-08-07","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"We didn't put on the theater component of the events.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q2","e":"rba","d":"2020-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"…a very positive buyer experience, based on customer feedback and our ability to quickly pivot to a 100% online, has not only shown the international market our online capabilities, but proven that we can deliver exceptional price realization on this platform during these uncertain times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q2","e":"rba","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Cherniavsky","x":"But I'm a little surprised and maybe a bit curious on whether or not you guys were surprised by how much cost savings or at least how many costs were related to running those auctions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2020-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"This is supported by the numbers, as we are now seeing year-over-year price increases on a mix adjusted basis here in the U.S. and Canada for used equipment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2020-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"I would add that our disciplined approach to at-risk deals, particularly inventory contracts, combined with strong price realization drove these results, and we are very pleased with overall rate performance during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ann Fandozzi","x":"Sharon will speak about what we expect our cost savings to be in a pandemic environment going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"Also, we have a onetime adjustment to net income of $3.2 million after-tax due to severance costs incurred in the quarter related to the realignment of leadership to support the new global operations organization as well as to position talent to deliver on our strategic growth priorities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q4","e":"rba","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ann Fandozzi","x":"Additionally, our data science team continues to focus on Auction science to understand how we can improve price realization using the various technology tools and channels we have at our disposal such as marketplaces.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2020 Q4","e":"rba","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"We are continuing to see equipment tightness in our early Q1 sales events as the US consigners appear to be taking a wait and see approach to better assess new equipment availability and used equipment price realization from the Florida auction events.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"SG&A growth was impacted by significantly stronger performance-based incentive increases, severance, foreign exchange impacts, the addition of Rouse Services employees and executive management changes that begin to comp fully in Q2 of 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"Excluding the bonus, share-based compensation and severance impacts in the quarter, our SG&A grew only 4.4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/ritchie-brothers-auctioneers-inc-rba-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q2","e":"rba","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"Although the key message here is that, even with these adverts, we do expect a permanent level of cost savings going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/07/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-inc-rba-q2-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2021-11-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Ann Fandozzi","x":"In the third quarter, we had hoped to welcome back customers to our auction theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q3","e":"rba","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"Although, the key message here is that even with these add-backs we do expect a permanent level of cost savings going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-inc-rba-q3-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q4","e":"rba","d":"2022-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Cherilyn Radbourne","x":"I'll pass it on to someone else.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-rba-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"RBA 2021 Q4","e":"rba","d":"2022-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sabahat Khan","x":"Wondered if you could just confirm if that's correct, and maybe how broad-based or the magnitude of those price increases were.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-rba-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"RBA 2022 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon Driscoll","x":"However, this includes $5.4 million in share-based payments and $2.3 million in nonrecurring advisory, legal and restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/ritchie-bros-auctioneers-rba-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"RBA 2025 Q4","e":"rba","d":"2026-02-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James F. Kessler","x":"We are in such a unique environment with tariffs and interest rates and everything that has been going on externally, but we are starting to see our partners talk in a different manner than they have in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/ea