ool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/rb-global-rba-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric J. Guerin","x":"We do have some contracts where we can pass that through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/rb-global-rba-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric J. Guerin","x":"Others, where that does not get passed through, it would be a headwind for the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/rb-global-rba-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric J. Guerin","x":"We are concentrating on the elements within our control, including advancing cost-savings initiatives, deploying technology designed to enhance yard-level efficiency, and executing against our operating model to drive productivity and operating leverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/rb-global-rba-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael J. Feniger","x":"I heard you earlier talk about cost savings and yard efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/rb-global-rba-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric J. Guerin","x":"We are raising our 2026 outlook and now expect gross transaction value to grow between 6% and 9% for the full year, with adjusted EBITDA growth of approximately 8% at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/rb-global-rba-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBA 2026 Q1","e":"rba","d":"2026-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James F. Kessler","x":"And I think we feel the confidence of the team's execution as t